/// counterexample via `hegel_run_result_failure_count` /
/// `hegel_run_result_failure`.
/// - `HEGEL_RUN_STATUS_ERROR`: the run itself failed — a failed health
/// check, a nondeterministic test, an engine panic — and produced no
